  "description": "A squirrel beastman, lost both his guardian and his home in an instant, lived in a park in his squirrel form to escape loan sharks demanding money he never borrowed. He then meets a suspicious and handsome man named Samuheon. Feeling comfortable in the kindness of the man who hands him nuts and cranberries every day, Garam unexpectedly finds himself destined to become his pet squirrel.    \n\n“Come to think of it… is our squirrel a male?”    \n“Squirrel, shall we eat?”    \n“Are squirrels normally this smart?”    \n\nAlthough Garam feels burdened by Samuheon treating him like a pet without knowing he is a beastman, he ends up becoming tamed by his sweet touch. Then one day, he is shocked to discover that the man who had been so kind to him is actually a director at the loan company that has been tormenting him…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297090030)  \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297090031)",
